        "Groundcover is an observability platform that collects traces and infrastructure telemetry. Its new integration ingests Claude Platform traces so engineers can inspect model requests and agent tool use alongside the services those agents call. Groundcover says that previously the agent loop and the application infrastructure could live in separate views, making it harder to follow a request across them.",
